00:05:19.319 --> 00:05:22.422
This time around, we want the agent to query for

118
00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:25.725
and use data before it responds

119
00:05:26.092 --> 00:05:28.795
with any declarative generative UI components.

120
00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:32.799
To simulate this, we're going to define a get sales data tool

121
