this would query some API or a database.

124
00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:43.943
In this example here, we're just hardcoding

125
00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.312
some sales data for the agent to use.

126
00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:48.114
This is not our core focus,

127
