here, you can come back to this point later.

129
00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:53.886
Now that we've created the tool, we're going to create an agent.

130
00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:56.422
Just as before, this is a standard

131
00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:59.292
LangChain Deep Agent powered by GPT 4.1 model.

