00:06:25.952 --> 00:06:27.854
Most of the code here is very familiar.

141
00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.823
We're setting up a standard connector to our LangChain agent

142
00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:34.026
that we set up on port 8004. And we're initializing the Copilot

143
00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.162
runtime with that agent as the default agent.

