not want to include this tool automatically,

153
00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:04.991
you can always exclude it by passing false to this argument.

154
00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:07.994
We're now going to define our declarative generative UI component catalog.

155
00:07:08.394 --> 00:07:11.397
Remember, the Component Catalog consists of two parts,

156
00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:14.700
the component definitions and the component renderers.

157
00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.170
