00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:23.876
explain what it is that we pasted in a minute.

162
00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.680
All right. This is our demonstrationCatalogDefinitions.

163
00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.785
You see here, there's a dictionary of components with their definitions.

164
00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:35.688
The first component here is the Title component.

165
00:07:36.088 --> 00:07:37.790
It has a name, Title,

166
00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.493
a description, in this case a heading,

167
00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:43.463
used for section titles and page headers,

168
00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:46.466
and props, typed schemas using

169
