00:09:13.819 --> 00:09:16.322
is how you can get your own custom stylings

204
00:09:16.422 --> 00:09:18.925
when using declarative generative UI.

205
00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:23.229
Simply make your component renderers aware of your design style guides.

206
00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:25.731
Now let's scroll down to the bottom of the renderers file.

207
00:09:26.098 --> 00:09:29.502
quite a few renderers in there. All right.

